@flexiarg pattern-interpretation/declare-the-universe
@title Declare The Fact Universe With Meaning, Method, Value And Grain
@keywords token-universe, facts, unknown, grain, threshold, admission, closed-world
@audience interpretation jobs, admission reviewers
@tone technical
@style pattern
@status draft 2026-09-16 (claude-7; admission rules F1, F5, F6, F8 from futon2 holes/labs/wm-contract/WORKED-INSTANCES-pattern-interpretation-2026-09-16.md; meaning of tokens is claude-4's D2-D3)
@references [pattern-interpretation/compile-guards-exactly pattern-interpretation/put-uncertainty-in-theta translation/declare-what-is-preserved hygiene/exempt-the-in-use]
@see-also hygiene/classify-by-remedy-judgement
@how each fact carries a meaning, a method of observation, citations and a value in {true, false, :unknown}. Rules: (1) facts meaning "this cycle's step is done" are false at cycle start — an observation, not an unknown; (2) :unknown is only for facts not observed, never a belief (priors go to θ or C); (3) a threshold-derived fact is admissible only with its declared threshold and source (e.g. ahead > 10, promote_push.clj:15); (4) a new fact must not duplicate the meaning of an admitted one, and a reviewer checks meanings; (5) the universe has a declared grain (cycle, repo, handoff×namespace), and per-item invariants stay in adapters and gates; (6) the universe is frozen within a tick, extended only by admission with new facts entering as :unknown, and candidates are compared only over the same universe.
@violation-signature buffer cleaner: declaring exemptions-recorded :unknown stops the cascade at step 2 without error. Inbox zero: without the declared threshold, unpushed-outlier is unknown and blocks both push and escalate; naming a fact change-reported instead of change-routed-to-actor hides the gap the pattern exists to catch. Per-buffer grounding of 134 buffers would be ~670 facts and needs quantifiers the guard language lacks.
! conclusion: Admit facts with meaning, method and value; progress facts start false, unknown means unobserved, thresholds carry sources, meanings are unique, and the universe has a grain and is frozen per tick.

  + context: Interpretation jobs declare facts while reading patterns for a mission, increasingly inside the running tick.

  + IF:
    An interpretation introduces or relies on facts.

  + HOWEVER:
    Unknown is the safe-looking default and stalls cascades; agents invent near-synonyms; and grain chosen per item explodes the universe.

  + THEN:
    Apply the six admission rules before any interpretation using the fact is admitted.

  + BECAUSE:
    The fact vocabulary is shared by every pattern in the cascade, so an error in it affects all of them at once.

  + evidence: worked instances §1 (buffer cleaner, F1, F5), §2 (inbox zero, F6, F8), §3 (test registry, F10: an undeclared lane stays unknown).
